  "limitations": [
    "Validated execution covers pySCENIC GRNBoost2, a declared table-backed cisTarget ranking resource, motif pruning, AUCell, and SCENIC+ scoring of already evidence-backed eRegulons. The public GSE96583 case validates label-withheld GRNBoost2 coexpression programs, AUCell scoring, and paired-condition external review, but deliberately does not call those programs motif-pruned regulons because no production cisTarget ranking resource is supplied. Project analyses still require species- and genome-matched production ranking and motif resources, experimentally defensible region-gene evidence, donor-aware downstream inference, and independent validation. The module does not establish direct binding or causal regulation and requires a compatible project-approved scientific runtime."
  ],
